00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:32.590
have always been pitted 
against great challenges.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:37.420
In short, all life should have DNA which

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:39.780
allows them to face said challenges!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.060
Y-You can't be serious!

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:43.270
I won't give up!

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:47.240
For that is the only way 
in which we can fight!

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:48.420
We won't give up!

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:50.270
For each of us will...

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.030
...come together for 
the future of mankind!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:56.240
And now the time has come 
for us to make use of this!

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:00.700
There we go...

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:03.710
I put it down.

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:07.040
Indeed!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:14.810
Behold.

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.090
Th-This is...

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:18.640
I thought that this might happen,

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.930
so I had this already prepared...

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:22.470
A machine to produce the Pheromone Breaker
(Name subject to change).

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:25.480
I haven't tested it yet, but...

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:26.850
And...

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.980
The instructions on how to 
make it are written here!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:32.850
Impressive.

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:34.110
Way to go, Todayama!

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:38.070
Now let's make the Pheromone Breaker
(Name subject to change) immediately!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.360
Go!

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:40.780
Go!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.410
It seems all my servants have gathered.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.250
Now let us go then.

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:50.730
Go? Where?

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:54.260
The place where I shall 
become this world's ruler.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.560
This smell...

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:00.120
It can't be.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:09.180
This must be Kyouko-san's doing.

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:10.230
Onee-sama's?

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:14.230
At these levels, 
it won't have much effect,

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.240
but I can't sit still.

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:17.800
Y-Yes.

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:20.910
They're coming.

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.530
That's as far as you go.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.800
We won't let you take another step!

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:37.460
Oh? You ran away and now you're back.

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:41.550
I guess you just can't 
forget me, your fiancé.

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:42.700
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:44.630
I'm here to rescue Izumiko!

00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:45.810
Neko-sensei, too!

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:46.980
Perfect timing.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:50.490
How about I have all of you 
become my servants right now?

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:52.440
Pheromones.

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:54.500
That's not going to work!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:57.470
We ate a bunch of konpeito 
just a moment ago.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:19:00.780
Burpity burp. It's coming 
up all sweet...

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:03.490
I'm also fine because 
I have my earplugs.

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:07.270
But you're having a 
normal conversation...

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:12.020
Yes, I'm able to concentrate 
more, so I'm able to read lips.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:13.170
I see..

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.680
Looks like I have no choice.

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:17.990
Time to use a little force.

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:21.290
Here they come!

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:23.080
Oh, my. Looks like a problem.

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:25.010
Give me back my Neko-sensei!

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.360
Stay awayjsakfosd.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:40.030
Everyone, calm down.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:45.210
They should give us some time.

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:47.900
If we can't walk straight out,

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:49.400
then we'll have to go this way, Izumiko.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:51.040
Yes, Itsuki-sama.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:52.790
I won't let you!

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:04.290
Club President Iseda.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.660
I will be the one facing you.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:13.010
Todayama-san, I'll take care of her.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:15.310
Thanks!

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:21.490
Well, I never thought I'd be back here.

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:23.800
Noya Itsuki!

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:25.700
Well, then.

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:29.200
You're going to give Izumiko back to me!

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:31.620
And you can make me do that?

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.110
I'm damn well gonna try!

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:46.760
Your rampage ends here!

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:48.740
Are you actually...

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:50.920
going to shoot me, your fiancé?

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:51.890
Don't move!

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.770
I shoot first and ask questions later.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.320
Onee-sama!

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.760
Move out of the way, Izumiko!

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:04.560
You're just being affected 
by the pheromones!

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:05.740
Get a hold of yourself!

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:07.780
I know what I'm doing.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.940
Then why are you standing in my way?!

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:14.540
It's because I've always 
hated you, Onee-sama.

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:18.630
That's right... You always

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:22.490
take what is precious to me.

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:28.760
I'm tired of having to experience that!

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:30.150
Izumiko!

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:31.450
What are you saying?!

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:34.770
Izumiko...

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:37.770
I see you're in the middle of 
a beautiful drama here, but...

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:39.920
I'll be ending this.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.380
You son of a...

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:56.880
Well done, Izumiko.

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:58.570
Now, come with me.

00:21:58.570 --> 00:21:59.390
Right.

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:01.000
Wait...

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.730
Wait, Izumiko!

00:22:03.730 --> 00:22:05.750
Goodbye, Onee-sama.

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:10.510
Izumiko...

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:19.100
Are you okay?

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:21.710
I'm fine...

00:22:21.710 --> 00:22:23.030
But where...

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:24.170
They used it...

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:27.030
The Astronomy Club's 
secret escape passage!

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:34.400
Finally...

00:22:35.180 --> 00:22:40.540
Finally the time has come for me 
to become this world's ruler.

00:22:42.970 --> 00:22:45.460
What's going to happen now?

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:46.800
Who knows...

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:48.990
What should we do, Todayama?!

00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:52.470
We're in this dire situation, and...

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:53.320
And?

00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:59.280
And I can't help but think 
this is gonna get fun.

00:24:30.300 --> 00:24:32.560
Today, the Astronomy Club battles with 
Student Council President Iseda again!

00:24:32.560 --> 00:24:34.360
Finish her off with a star-gazing kit!

00:24:32.970 --> 00:24:34.780
<b>Secret Compass / Shooting Constellation Starchart Red Flashlight / Shrimp-Style (Ebi-Style) Revolver</b>

00:24:34.360 --> 00:24:35.920
Do you understand how 
strong the Astronomy Club

00:24:35.920 --> 00:24:37.580
is now, Student Council President Iseda?

00:24:37.580 --> 00:24:40.190
Astronomy Club Secret Star-Gazing Kit!

00:24:37.580 --> 00:24:40.190
Next Time: "The Astronomy Club's Great Victory! Ready, Go 'till Tomorrow!!"

00:24:37.580 --> 00:24:40.190
<b>New</b>

00:24:37.580 --> 00:24:40.190
<b>Astronomy Club Secret</b>

00:24:37.580 --> 00:24:40.190
<b>Star-gazing Kit</b>
